# 统一换行：样本、契约、数据与前端页面一律 LF，避免 CI 与 Windows 之间的 diff 噪声。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.zip binary
assurance/fixtures/** text eol=lf
